     "said": [
      "Two different protected area networks were investigated: the extant regional and national protected area network (RNAs) and the wider and incompletely implemented Natura 2000 network of protected areas (N2000) (see Fig.",
      "RNAs are at the core of national and regional conservation policies, and include National and Natural Parks, Natural Reserves, Natural Monuments, Protected Landscapes, Protected Marine Areas (not included in this study) as well as different types of local protected areas (i.e."
