     "choice": "measured",
     "probs": {
      "measured": 0.921,
      "literature": 0.079
     },
     "said": [
      "To do this, we compared observed $\\gamma$ and b TD or FD to expected values from 1000 random draws of an equal number of cells, taken from the pool of grid cells where species have been recorded (including both protected and unprotected cells).",
      "In the case of $\\propto \\mathrm { T D }$ and FD, we assessed whether values of TD and FD in protected grid cells were significantly greater than in unprotected cells using nonparametric Wilcoxon–Mann–Whitney tests."
     ],
     "value": "measured"
    }
   }
  },
